he calcium bicarbonate ratios that at higher concentrations are below seawater ratios. Top right shows the sodium magnesium ratios that at higher concentrations are below seawater ratios. Middle right shows the sodium-bicarbonate ratios that at higher con\
centrations are below seawater ratios. Bottom left shows the magnesium bicarbonate ratios that are below seawater ratios.)/K 3/P 29 0 R/Pg 48735 0 R/S/Figure>>
