dotted line showing the expected ratio for seawater.\nOn each graph, there is a red dotted line showing the expected ratios associated with the dissolution of \(a\) thenardite, \(b\) epsomite, and \(c\) gypsum.\n)/K 4/P 29 0 R/Pg 48736 0 R/S/Figure>>
